        "Content": "<ul><li> Substantial 200 sq.m four-bedroom residence offering exceptional space for modern family </li><li> Large 0.72 acre mature site providing privacy, scope, and an attractive rural backdrop. </li><li> Well-designed internal layout with excellent room proportions </li><li> Versatile converted conservatory, ideal as a relaxation room, playroom, home office </li><li> A well-maintained home with the opportunity for light decorative enhancement </li><li> Peaceful countryside setting just outside Ballyjamesduff, combining tranquillity with convenience </li><li> Close proximity to primary and secondary schools, making it an excellent choice for families </li><li> Strong regional connectivity to Cavan, Longford, Mullingar, and Navan for work, services </li><li> Plumbed for Oil fired central heating - Burner needs to be installed </li><li> Bio Cycle Sewerage, Group Water</li></ul>"
